---
title: "balanceOfUnderlying (Compound V2: cTokens)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_accrue: accrueInterest()
    q_accrue --> q_get_exchange: exchangeRate = exchangeRateStored()
    q_get_exchange --> q_calc: underlyingBalance = accountTokens[account] * exchangeRate
    q_calc --> [*]: return underlyingBalance

    note right of q_calc
        INV-001: underlyingBalance = cTokenBalance * exchangeRate
        INV-002: underlyingBalance monotonically non-decreasing over time (for lenders)
        INV-003: sum of all balanceOfUnderlying <= getCash + totalBorrows - totalReserves
    end note
